    "question": {
      ":question/id": "29058172-56a7-581f-b940-d2e590889a2a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the curve with parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{4}\\right),\\qquad y=\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nConsider the following table of values. Angles are in radians.\n\n| **$t$** | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ | $a$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ |\n| $y$ | $b$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |\n\n| **$t$** | $3$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $c$ | $-1$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |\n\nFind the exact value of $a+b+c$.\n\n{{result}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The $a$ entry is in the $x$-row under $t=0$. Substitute into $x=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{4}\\right)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a &=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi \\left(0\\right)}{4}\\right) \\\\ &=\\cos\\left(0\\right) \\\\ &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $b$ entry is in the $y$-row under $t=-1$. Substitute into $y=\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{3}\\right)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b &=\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi \\left(-1\\right)}{3}\\right) \\\\ &=\\tan\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $c$ entry is in the $x$-row under $t=3$. Substitute into $x=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{4}\\right)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c &=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi \\left(3\\right)}{4}\\right) \\\\ &=\\cos\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute the three entries with the signs in the requested expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+b+c &=\\left(1\\right)+\\left(- \\sqrt{3}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\sqrt{3} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe completed table is\n\n| **$t$** | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ | $1$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ |\n| $y$ | $- \\sqrt{3}$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |\n\n| **$t$** | $3$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ | $-1$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
